# Dev-only: `aio app dev` runs each action from its source directory but does not
# apply the deployment-time `include` entries in app.config.yaml. The Enforcer
# calls in actions/templates/*/index.js load `./template-registry-api.json`, so
# local symlinks provide the spec at that cwd-relative path without duplicating it.
actions/templates/*/template-registry-api.json
